[{"title":"金台观","author":"陈于陛","text":"丹岩玉洞倚云平，十二雕栏瞰五城。\n阁道西来通阆苑，渭川东去入蓬瀛。\n钓璜人远螭谁获，祠宝台湮雉自鸣。\n王业伯图成底事，翛然从此学长生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31312,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重九同学舍诸生游金台观","author":"黄肇宏","text":"廿年旧事吾能记，古寺秋风听鹿鸣。\n直雀抡才同此日，来年报捷望诸生。\n蟠龙山访前贤迹，市骏台争上国名。\n腾达云霄各努力，老夫端不愧持衡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31313,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题张果栖隐处","author":"刘星轸","text":"我爱消灾崖，此中有佳处。\n桥涉嘉陵江，逶迤纵云步。\n中有一径通，盘折无层数。\n秀石悬空崖，幽窈多清趣。\n凭栏远望间，意迷入山路。\n惟见清冥合，山川起烟雾。\n传云张果仙，栖此发神悟。\n长啸惟幽人，白云自来去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31314,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋亭","author":"朱子春","text":"宰官终日劳，而我耽于逸。\n偶得簿书閒，未忘山水癖。\n城北豆积山，旧有果仙迹。\n洞府凿何年，清虚倚绝壁。\n棋局昔安排，摹挲看一一。\n有亭翼其上，就中可容席。\n平收山色青，俯瞰河流碧。\n道旁车马喧，城中市廛密。\n熙熙与攘攘，成败曷有极。\n异哉张元通，沧桑几阅历。\n眼前皆苍生，利济岂无术。\n徵辟却不受，澄怀殊静谧。\n笑问洞中仙，云何此安宅。\n入山不见深，入林不见僻。\n有唐天宝时，此为故道驿。\n车驾自东来，公卿多扈跸。\n毕竟忧世心，神仙已早释。\n贱子苦束缚，一官寄斯邑。\n牒诉理未遑，琴书敢自适。\n今年麦有秋，抚绥易筹画。\n登山且纵饮，赋诗兼对奕。\n宾寮颓然醉，醉归日已夕。\n公去棋自留，我来亭始辟。\n传后未可知，幽怀共今昔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31315,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋亭","author":"杜显鋆","text":"豆积古仙洞，仄径何崔嵬。\n上有铁棋局，斑剥弃莓苔。\n搆亭相拂拭，贤侯意悠哉。\n春风复秋月，我常此徘徊。\n烹茶爇山叶，寻句索松煤。\n当轩碧空净，眼界豁然开。\n城市依山麓，河流环涧隈。\n石枰作筵席，放豪时举杯。\n坐听铁马响，心清涤尘埃。\n髣髴八仙至，飘飘会蓬莱。\n不觉瞑然醉，归已玉山隤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31316,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题张果洞","author":"田澍","text":"危崖构飞阁，虚空磴道悬。\n上有积翠缥缈之层巅。\n下有波涛迅激之深渊。\n攀萝蹑梯乃可上，遁形养性真通元。\n不知真人何处去，丹鼎烟飞迹俨然。\n洞中飞出白蝙蝠，千年不死成真仙。\n入朝曾应诏，步趋玉殿前。\n臣本方外士，不能缀班联。\n能令开元天子万万年。\n吁嗟乎蜀道险巇不可以径度，何不掷杖成桥引入大罗天。\n我来灵境瞻遗像，顿觉两腋习习凌风烟。\n洞中果老头已白，人世求仙真可怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31317,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋亭歌","author":"纪膺","text":"吾乡朱侯颇好奇。\n邀我走马黄花湄。\n又向崔巍访张果，云有石枰留铁棋。\n下马谛视真奇古。\n三十二枚范金土。\n一枚直重四十铢，可惜神仙不留谱。\n有唐逮今百千年。\n阅尽沧桑几变迁。\n此物疑有鬼神护，雨淋日炙尚依然。\n公馀更约恣游赏。\n作亭覆之殊疏敞。\n丁丁伐木起云端，每值良辰惬孤往。\n我闻侯治政绩明。\n民安堵兮岁功成。\n废者复之颓者举，坐听四境胪欢声。\n即今翼然亭高妙。\n邦人来游呼且笑。\n春花秋月担壶觞，从此流风遍岭峤。\n他日仙人倘息凫。\n旧时遗局记应无。\n问谁为亭意孔都。\n佥曰为我父母侯姓朱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31318,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"侍家大人陪幕中诸公宴铁棋亭","author":"朱永锡","text":"课馀恰值雨初晴。\n为访仙踪载酒罂。\n琴鹤长随知政理，亭台高会话升平。\n山环豆积洞谁凿，水下嘉陵河有声。\n毕竟神仙不可接，肯将忧乐负苍生。\n鸿爪勾留倏五年。\n重看云物到层巅。\n一枰成败无终局，千古兴亡欲问仙。\n凤岭平开晴日丽，马当争羡好风便。\n茫茫国手当谁属，听罢棋声却惘然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31319,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋亭 其一","author":"侯鸣珂","text":"神仙幻境杳千秋。\n香火因缘岁一酬。\n笑我公馀无个事，也随士女共遨游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31320,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋亭 其二","author":"侯鸣珂","text":"屹立苍崖碧水横。\n嵌空石洞瞰山城。\n铁棋果是真仙迹，要与先生试一枰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31321,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋仙迹","author":"郭建本","text":"仙踪传果老，豆积费推求。\n一局棋谁胜，千年子未收。\n蝠飞曾道破，鹤去尚来不。\n洞里春常在，尘心象外游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31322,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"萧寺晨钟","author":"郭建本","text":"古刹山崖上，祇园望里逢。\n青围萧寺柏，晨听上方钟。\n宝盖明残烬，鲸铿彻远峰。\n迷途如可觉，到耳韵从容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31323,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"萧寺晨钟","author":"郑谦","text":"残星隐隐月朦胧。\n卧听钟声逐晓风。\n断续遥传萧寺外，悠扬时度乱云中。\n三生唤醒杯堪渡，万里惊回梦未终。\n惆怅馀音留不得，芙蓉十二漏催铜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31324,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"萧寺晨钟","author":"朱子春","text":"上界钟声响遏云。\n西风吹梦醒尘氛。\n禅林初日盘空出，莲塔馀音趁晓闻。\n常共佛怀殷利济，早窥民隐惕忧勤。\n山城绝少繁丝竹，坐听蒲牢息众纷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31325,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋仙迹","author":"朱子春","text":"洞府何年橘叟来。\n就中亭阁好安排。\n迎门道士閒如寄，弹局神仙去不回。\n烟火万家环县郭，河流终古抱山隈。\n苍茫陵谷增人感，石壁题诗扫绿苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31326,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"萧寺晨钟","author":"纪膺","text":"我谒凤州侯，侯居我莲幕。\n伏枕忧百端，意境殊萧索。\n忽闻古寺钟，顿解利名缚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31327,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋仙迹","author":"纪膺","text":"晨陟豆积山，言访古仙史。\n铁棋留石枰，游戏聊尔尔。\n世事如棋看，生憎错著子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31328,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"铁棋仙迹","author":"田澍","text":"上山逢白叟，疑是张果老。\n化为白蝙蝠，乘云去缥缈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31329,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"萧寺晨钟","author":"田澍","text":"山寺逼层霄。\n晨钟破寂寥。\n一声客梦醒，恍似泊枫桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31330,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寇莱公墓","author":"汪仲洋","text":"御盖忽上澶州城，嵩呼动地声雷鸣。\n孤注一掷得全采，莱公手眼原分明。\n不尔六飞走楚蜀，岂待高宗弃雨京。\n功高谤速易媒糵，好刚使气微骄矜。\n瘿相何尝是裴度，文皇早已知魏徵。\n建储三言决大计，宰相进贤不用例。\n大节无惭社稷臣，廷辩翻输雀鼠智。\n张咏临歧教读书，魏野修笺劝避位。\n天书但解献朱能，犊车讵料藏丁谓。\n蒸羊远饷拂须儿，闭门纵博如当时。\n蜡泪成堆醒大梦，犀带束腰知死期。\n欲拜华州相公墓，请读皇祐旌功碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31331,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寇莱公墓","author":"赵怀玉","text":"一战能收河北兵，前星亦赖片言明。\n大臣曾定宫中策，天子偏羞城下盟。\n传读霍光心本悟，雠忘丁谓气何平。\n道旁枯竹犹重活，何怪坟前宰树荣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31332,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望老君山","author":"蒋薰","text":"老君山在眼，日夕起秋烟。\n翠落孤云外，丹含反照边。\n鸟飞知去路，鹿过想耕田。\n应是岩阿里，能容勾漏仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31333,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南山谣","author":"蒋薰","text":"池中有灰，石中无煤。\n持此镵斧，伐彼崔巍。\n宁耕渭阳田，不用陇西钱。\n折我肱，塌我肩。\n谁为此，老君山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31334,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋逢雨不果还羌二首 其二","author":"蒋薰","text":"老君山上湿云多，小落门西渭水波。\n秋雨丝丝秋士泪，欲行不得也哥哥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31335,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金天观","author":"李文","text":"琳宫寻羽客，野服过仙家。\n溪合双流水，桃开一片霞。\n午香烧柏子，春酿压松花。\n归路重回首，云横石径斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31336,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰州怀古四首 其三","author":"董平章","text":"乾隆中叶盛，民气四方恬。\n蠢尔花门种，居然草泽潜。\n山空龙尾踞，渠旋马头歼。\n凭吊金天观，昆冈烬尚炎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31337,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰州行","author":"蒋薰","text":"金城睥睨蔽旌旄，届注黄河深作濠。\n关门西通沙井曲，塞垣东绕摩云高。\n汉家防羌赵营平，能逐先零使遁逃。\n至今皋兰绝毳窟，维舟铁柱铭功劳。\n河间礼乐真龙种，梁苑词华落凤毛。\n炎衰无复灵光殿，金天观外生蓬蒿。\n设网洪流鲂鱮泣，合围空碛虎狼号。\n将军已定天山箭，节度从容佩吕刀。\n五泉不敢来饮马，哥舒休使战临洮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31338,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金天观感怀","author":"蒋薰","text":"琼宫龙尾北，灏气肃金天。\n别岛藏槐国，流霞引隺年。\n玉棺无墓土，丹灶但寒烟。\n王子吹笙去，阿千空望仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31339,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登大像山","author":"周铣","text":"万山祖昆崙，支裔如析木。\n巨灵舒半臂，移来小天竺。\n直竖千刃高，横亘一峦矗。\n平立睨天门，向背见要腹。\n巀嵲群岫中，千里归结束。\n上界辟鹦林，真源佳气独。\n暇日得跻攀，肩舆止平陆。\n宛转蹑龙脊，崎岖登云麓。\n临崖一眺望，遥天关画轴。\n四围俨列屏，尽向此山伏。\n俯首瞰平川，町畦共联属。\n天雨新麦苗，油然殊众绿。\n渠水活且盈，一线通盘曲。\n整衣礼旃檀，再拜愈齐遫。\n他福非有邀，丰年是所祝。\n吾蜀饶名山，峨眉未登瞩。\n嵩华心徒想，匡卢耳亦熟。\n何幸山水缘，遇兹畅所欲。\n一年两陟巅，佳景饱经目。\n山花袭我衣，归来尚馥郁。\n静夜涤烦嚣，疑在峰头宿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31340,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旧八景诗之悬崖大像","author":"曹思义","text":"何年石破忽惊天，撒乎空空万仞前。\n跌坐不须城内食，妙香岂假烬中烟。\n层层头点生公石，曲曲波环大士莲。\n惭愧君亲恩未报，敢抛经济说神仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31341,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冶海冰图","author":"苏履吉","text":"冶海呈奇异，寒流结素冰。\n虚心生万象，皓质起千层。\n壁射灵光耀，人惊爽气澄。\n瑶池常献彩，此景最宜称。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31342,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冶海冰图","author":"陈钟秀","text":"茫茫冶海水平堤，万状冰图望眼迷。\n知是龙宫多妙手，故教呈出待人题。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31343,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"土俗歌","author":"无名氏","text":"庵头广积连玄石，西凉下国相临畔。\n峪虚林秋有夜雨，古碑烈士段公贤。\n土产石鱼岂有异，自古题名乱石滩。\n邀崖梁武?天井，赖老白松万万年。\n琵琶昭君投晖河，早照朝元晚暺川。\n华绿三川近龙泉，庞公打鱼成圣贤。\n鸟蛇瓜牛出华湾，大小石门有海眼。\n古城龙头出士宦，沙沟紧接毗卢原。\n玉清镇隔龟蛇岭，汧流入渭透长安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31344,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 其二","author":"严绳孙","text":"江南好，一片石头城。\n细雨飞来矶燕小，暖风扶上纸鸢轻。\n依约是清明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31345,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨闷坐忆循良先生","author":"孙思敬","text":"那堪终日雨，兀坐守柴扃。\n搅我心如醉，怜君眼独醒。\n烟迷千树白，云锁一山青。\n却忆重阳节，潇潇倚枕听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31346,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀周菊人襟兄兼山中诸友","author":"孙思敬","text":"记得秋风里，相逢曾尽欢。\n谈心何月小，见面几人难。\n欹枕雨飞急，挑灯花落残。\n含情当此夕，胸果为谁宽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31347,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠循良先生","author":"孙思敬","text":"天地清高气，斯人一木持。\n素心余自守，大道世谁知。\n松柏有真性，风云无定时。\n何当日趋步，书曰善为师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31348,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄过子贤","author":"孙思敬","text":"春意回岭表，诗人兴若何。\n湖边烟景丽，山外夕阳多。\n草色浓于黛，花阴淡似萝。\n清明知日近，可作踏青歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31349,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日闲望","author":"孙思敬","text":"春意如人意，凭栏试一经。\n风吹湖色绿，草没屐痕青。\n写景浑如画，衔杯忍独醒。\n会须致佳客，相赏坐闲亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31350,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别周菊人襟兄","author":"孙思敬","text":"聚久难为别，离情未易描。\n寒山留落日，萧馆冷诗瓢。\n犹忆来荒墅，偷闲步小桥。\n片帆归去也，何日慰岑寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31351,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盆菊盛开有一本而异色者绚彩呈妍各极其致可以人而不如花乎赋此以示九弟","author":"孙思敬","text":"偶玩庭阶菊，浑于种或差。\n同根偏异质，吐彩焕奇葩。\n元气中和抱，深工造物加。\n相看须努力，各自爱芳华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31352,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重游管社","author":"孙思敬","text":"仿佛三生影，模糊到眼前。\n人家浑不识，身世两茫然。\n野老还能忆，烹茶略话缘。\n归来频屈指，三十有余年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31353,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元旦谒祖","author":"孙思敬","text":"整肃衣冠拜，心香一炷供。\n河山渺前代，袍笏仰遗容。\n累叶贻谋远，连枝庇荫浓。\n愿从今伊始，祠飨答吾宗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31354,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和邑令郭愚谷先生中秋遣怀","author":"孙思敬","text":"今夕谁家秋兴多，团圞应不让嫦娥。\n倘然造化无知识，佳节寻常一例过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31355,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾君望三借来棉袍一件作此谢之","author":"孙思敬","text":"布被尖寒入梦频，风高雨烈扫浮尘。\n知君雅抱怜才意，一领绨袍共故人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31356,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀陆循良先生四首 其一","author":"孙思敬","text":"托迹连年似转篷，伯劳西去雁飞东。\n谁知同作天涯客，光景依稀两地同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31357,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀陆循良先生四首 其二","author":"孙思敬","text":"记得湖山话别时，一壶浊酒解相思。\n而今转积相思恨，怕看仙人月小诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31358,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀陆循良先生四首 其三","author":"孙思敬","text":"绝意纷华百不求，先生自是忘机俦。\n山深林密长遗世，可是淮南身后不。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31359,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀陆循良先生四首 其四","author":"孙思敬","text":"懒逐风尘惟裹足，欲除烦恼只低头。\n不才自秘先生句，赢得挥成挂小楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31360,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续前韵再寄循良先生四首 其一","author":"孙思敬","text":"悟彻浮生一转篷，养花种竹舍西东。\n逍遥公得长生诀，到底神仙风致同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31361,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续前韵再寄循良先生四首 其二","author":"孙思敬","text":"春到江南不几时，高山流水寄新思。\n闲来小憩松阴下，一局围棋一首诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31362,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续前韵再寄循良先生四首 其三","author":"孙思敬","text":"跳出红尘不复求，相逢尽是采芝俦。\n飘然尚有凌云气，不道何人高也不。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31363,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续前韵再寄循良先生四首 其四","author":"孙思敬","text":"自叹蹉跎几度秋，繁华又到水山头。\n摹他雨意兼晴意，撚断吟髭坐小楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31364,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"孙思敬","text":"蜂狂蝶闹艳阳晨，越水吴山一例春。\n处世自求行乐耳，及时惟有钓耕人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31365,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄慨","author":"孙思敬","text":"穷通惟命敢憎时，摩蝎临宫亦自知。\n只有一般最难忍，看他亲友慰劳诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31366,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨有感","author":"孙思敬","text":"一夜东风可奈何，小桥流水远生波。\n天公不惜催春去，暮雨朝云暗里过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31367,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅宁望月","author":"孙思敬","text":"卅年儿女共盘桓，今日暂教客邸看。\n皎皎中天悬玉镜，当头照我十分圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31368,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏作","author":"孙思敬","text":"寒酸画出腐儒身，冠履全无一点新。\n惹得山妻开口笑，笑余酷似换糖人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31369,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"馆中见秋海棠","author":"孙思敬","text":"又值秋风七月天，我来合唤海棠颠。\n金钗十二分行列，看遍名花不要钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31370,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"嘲牛女","author":"孙思敬","text":"两情脉脉笑缘悭，一水盈盈隔往还。\n天上只多离别苦，何如谪堕在人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31371,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访云佩沈丈别后却寄二首 其一","author":"孙思敬","text":"才得相逢话别衷，临岐握手又匆匆。\n夕阳若与人方便，无限深情款款通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31372,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访云佩沈丈别后却寄二首 其二","author":"孙思敬","text":"犹忆前宵拇战哗，玉山颓后手还叉。\n醉乡拼得重来否，要佐谈锋酒当茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31373,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题半身梅月美人图","author":"孙思敬","text":"写来梅月亦精神，况有吟梅弄月人。\n如此丰姿已绝世，画图何必露全身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31374,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"斋中即事","author":"孙思敬","text":"云阴密密雨丝丝，兀坐空斋何所之。\n醉后闲寻孤客梦，灯前聊读故人诗。\n放翁有病惟茶癖，陶令多情只酒知。\n却喜红尘吹不到，萧然踪迹溷希夷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":31375,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]